*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0010
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 402
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0010.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 DAYS-LATE          PIC 9(3).
       88 DAYS-BAND-1-15 VALUE 1 THRU 15.
    *> STATEMENT AMOUNT DUE
    05 AMT-DUE            PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CALC-LATE-FEE
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
CALC-LATE-FEE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN DAYS-BAND-1-15
            MOVE 15 TO PENALTY-AMT
        WHEN DAYS-LATE >= 16 AND DAYS-LATE <= 30
            MOVE 50 TO PENALTY-AMT
        *> SERIOUSLY LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
        WHEN DAYS-LATE >= 31 AND DAYS-LATE <= 999
            COMPUTE PENALTY-AMT = AMT-DUE * 0.05
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO PENALTY-AMT
    END-EVALUATE.
